# SpecPlane YAML

When editing SpecPlane YAML (`capability.*`, `foundation.*`, `system.*`, `container.*`, `component.*`):

1. Confirm `meta.id` matches the filename without extension.
2. Load only the applicable section for this spec type from `specplane/core_prompt/applicable/README.md` (03 plus 04–07).
3. If you add `implements`, `uses`, or `dependencies.internal`, update the reciprocal field in the same change.
4. Bump `meta.version` and add a `changelog` entry.

Do not load the full v9.1.0 master prompt for a single-file edit.
